WEBVTT

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:04.320
Otoha-san?

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.420
Yes, the TimeSound Spirit.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.490
She's gone?

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.790
No.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:28.830
I'm sure she's watching. Quietly,
from somewhere we can't see her...

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:37.150
He met many people in this town.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:41.780
These meetings changed him,
and they changed the village.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.750
He, himself, was always searching
for something.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.710
He was searching for...

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:45.990
<b>Ninth Hour: Hozumi</b>

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.220
Almost time for the summer festival.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.710
Festival?

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.660
What? You don't know about it?

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:08.320
That bell's important. It's what got
your mom and dad together.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:15.360
Even as his younger brother,
I thought they made a good pair.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:19.180
Well, have fun.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.980
I see.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.670
That's why they always...

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.820
There really are a lot of bells.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.260
Y-Yeah.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:53.100
It's the village's one event.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:54.710
I see.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.110
I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.490
Is something wrong?

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:04.350
N-Nothing!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:09.150
U-Um, come to think of it,
I forgot something...

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.860
Go on.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.630
What are you doing?

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:16.730
Well... I figured the two of you
would want to be alone.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.020
What?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.430
It's you, Hotaru.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.410
Me? No way?

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.680
What are you doing?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.320
We'll be late.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.380
I-I forgot something, too!

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:27.610
Go on ahead!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.220
Hayami-chan!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:29.950
Bye!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.240
That's not fair!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:35.050
Hayami-chan!

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.490
What?

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.660
Really?

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.530
Yeah.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.110
I saw it myself.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.000
Hirose-kun came to school carrying a bell.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.230
He's going to give it to someone.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:51.590
So I rushed to get to school ahead of him.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.510
Why?

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:55.550
So he can give it to me, of course!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.240
Well, that's not going to happen...

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.940
Don't ignore me!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.880
You think it's probably Hotaru-chan,
with Kohinata-san as second?

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.780
I don't know.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.990
I think it's the other way around.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.760
Then who'd be the third choice?

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.330
Morning!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.170
What are you guys talking about?

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.090
No way.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.200
Not a chance.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.870
Oh, Hirose.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:31.620
Yui-chan, hi!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.010
You're not with Hotaru—

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.880
Th-That bell!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.270
Oh, this...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:37.800
Actually...

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.150
Wait!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.970
There's such a thing as a time and place!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:46.360
For you to just walk up to
the great Yui-sama and...

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:49.320
What's that haughty attitude?

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.200
Did you think I would accept it?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.940
D-Don't think so highly of yourself!

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.270
You're acting kinda funny.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:02.060
I've never thought at all about you!

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.260
Got it?

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.230
You think, maybe, Hirose-kun

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:07.910
doesn't know what the bell means?

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.450
It's possible!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.900
Girlfriend?!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.350
He didn't know.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.660
You use that bell when you
tell a girl you like her.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.950
L-Like her...

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:24.060
Before the festival, a guy gives
it to the girl he likes.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:29.270
If they like him back,
they show up at the festival wearing it!

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:31.960
In other words, you just
basically came to school

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:35.830
on Valentine's Day, carrying
a bunch of chocolate.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.860
That's why...

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.610
That's what he meant.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.340
But if they didn't come to school with you,

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.930
that means Hotaru-chan and Kohinata-san

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.500
are definitely thinking about it.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.060
But I didn't mean it...

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:53.080
I don't think you can get away with that,

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.960
after playing with a maiden's heart that way!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.880
Playing with...

00:06:56.880 --> 00:07:00.060
There's the poor maiden herself.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.340
Yui-chan?

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.810
I-If you want to say something to me,

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.400
I'll listen to it behind the school later!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.110
So call me out there!

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.850
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.490
<i>I didn't talk to them at all.</i>

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.460
<i>I think, at
this point, it won't end</i>

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.260
<i>until you give that bell to someone.</i>

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.730
<i>That's right.</i>

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:36.630
<i>But you know...</i>

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:41.010
I-I guess I'll go home.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:46.460
But I've got some time this afternoon.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.610
Maybe I'll go behind the school building...

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.730
Um... About this bell...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:54.520
Bye!

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:57.960
Hayami-chan, you've got it all wrong.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.560
Oh, no! It fell apart!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.980
I'm sorry.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:08.800
It's my fault.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.870
No, it's my fault.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:13.570
This is all a big misunderstanding,
so it's my fault.

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.070
Misunderstanding?

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.470
Yeah.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.010
This bell's a reminder of my mother.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:30.820
Then it was for your mother?

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:35.320
I thought I'd take it around the village...

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.990
I guess the timing was bad.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.840
No... I'm sure your mom is happy.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.800
Am I wrong?

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:52.810
Hirose-sama?

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.780
Yeah...

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.540
I hope you're right.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.700
Sorry, I've gotta stop somewhere today.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.840
Y-Yeah?

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:13.200
If it's a lot of work,
you don't have to fix the bell.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:13.930
See you!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.010
What's wrong with him?

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:25.110
What's Kohinata doing in the
middle of town like that?

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.710
Her family almost destroyed the village!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.210
But she had nothing to do with it.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.550
And once you talk to her, she's kind of nice.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.990
Don't be fooled!

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.320
That's what the Kohinatas do.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:43.230
She's planning revenge on the village.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.800
I know it!

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>Yeah... I hope you're right.</i>

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.330
It's kind of cold, but it feels good.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.830
Hotaru.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.080
I always wanted to try this, so I came by.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.340
It's deeper over there!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:09.880
Hayami-chan!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.200
Are you okay?

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:14.150
Don't panic. Just come over here,
and it'll be fine.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.410
Thank you.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.380
You were worried about Hirose, right?

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.030
Yeah.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:35.750
I was just thinking how far away he is from us.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.830
Yeah... He doesn't talk about himself.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:46.650
Does he not trust us?

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.160
If not, I'm gonna kick his butt.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.300
Um...

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.760
See what he has to say, okay?

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:03.570
You're the only one who can.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.610
You're better than me for that.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.910
I'm not good at those things.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.900
I can't.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:15.030
I tried to deceive him once.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.580
Hirose wouldn't still be mad about that.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.300
That's why I don't want to.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:50.900
How awful...

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.960
It's fine.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.070
Doesn't have to be for only a few days.

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.000
If you want, you can stay forever.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.970
But isn't it a bother?

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.010
Don't worry about it.

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.940
My uncle says it's fine.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.570
When we're in trouble,
we gotta help each other.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:19.910
But I'm...

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:23.540
A pretty young girl who lives
alone in the village.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.520
That's all.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:32.240
Anyway, I've got a village meeting to attend.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.110
You two have fun.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.330
Good luck, Tacky.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:54.080
I-I've got some food...

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:01.490
That fire could've spread over
the whole mountain!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:04.900
That isn't even Kohinata's land, to begin with.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.590
She has no right to live there.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.830
I think it would be best for
the village if we had her leave.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:15.600
But there is a possibility of arson.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.470
Well...

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:23.320
There was no real damage to the village.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:27.640
There's no need to rush, is there?

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.470
What do you mean, Chief?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.910
It's the Kohinatas we're talking about!

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:37.130
Isn't it time we forgot about the Kohinatas?

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:38.020
No...

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:43.820
Now, let's go over the procedure
for the festival.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.000
There's a roof over my head.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.360
Hirose!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.200
Hirose!

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:23.700
Hirose!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.380
Hirose!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.340
Hayami-chan?

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.400
Hirose!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.500
What's wrong?

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:31.430
Stop the shower!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.610
But...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.810
Hurry!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.750
What happened?

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:53.300
Jeez... You didn't have to hit me.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.410
It's your fault!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.460
I don't know...
You were the one who called me.

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.430
I asked you to turn it off.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.210
Not to peek.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.910
But I didn't peek...

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.210
Th-That's right.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.110
I'm sorry.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:14.070
But even so, you're too insensitive!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:14.980
Like today!

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.560
About the bell?

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.280
Not really, but...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.120
I'm sorry.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:28.630
I had no idea that the bell
carried that meaning...

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:37.680
Hey... Would you tell me about your mother?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.120
Why?

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:40.480
I want to hear it.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.820
It won't do you any good.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.860
It isn't a fun story.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.960
You don't want to talk about it?

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.470
That's not really it.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.010
Then tell me.

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.680
Hirose...

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.850
Nah.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:11.270
I... I don't know anything about you.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.560
Since I don't know, I can't talk to you.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:17.940
Since I don't know what's bothering you,

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:20.120
I don't know what to do for you.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.020
Hayami-chan!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.400
Do you not need me?

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.610
She killed herself.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.620
My mom killed herself.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:57.150
Leaving me behind...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.280
Be grateful for this!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.560
Chocolate bananas?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.110
Yum!

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:26.520
My mouth kinda itches...

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:28.450
These are Japanese yams!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.990
Yui-sama's special chocolate yams!

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:33.840
And the yams are jinenjo,
the king of Japanese yams,

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.530
beyond the reach of mere commoners!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.070
I see...

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.100
Itchy...

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:41.430
But Hirose's late...

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.570
It's the day of the festival.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.050
She still believes.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.540
She was pretty serious.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.230
You give this back to him.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:17.230
I hurt him...

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.850
He said he didn't want to talk
about it, but I was selfish.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:25.620
And I insisted. Even though he didn't want to.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.680
But...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.820
You were able to touch his heart.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:38.590
Why do you think he told you the truth?

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:52.970
Hirose-sama
came here a while ago.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.240
<i>I'll be waiting on the hill.</i>

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.880
<i>I want to see you there</i>, he said.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.370
I could feel his heart.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.630
The cycle of karma...

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:32.940
Stay by his side.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.590
Make him happy.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:46.950
That is my heart.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.090
It's fixed.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.960
Thanks.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.980
Hirose...

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.470
Um...

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.000
Hayami-chan!

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.140
Would you hold this for me?

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:40.700
I don't know really know about
this relationship stuff.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.350
But I want you by my side.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:47.800
I want you to know more about me.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.610
Is that not okay?

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.510
It's fine...

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.810
Are you sure about the two of them?

00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:06.830
Yes. If Hayami-chan is happy.

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:07.690
I see...

00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:12.950
May Hirose-sama go to Hell...

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:15.030
<b>Tenth Hour: Kohinata</b>

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:15.000
You're after Kohinata?!
